# ── outputs/ ships EMPTY (user rule): every film — brief, code, renders — is made fresh on the user's machine ──
outputs/*
!outputs/.gitkeep
**/out/

# ── Rebuilt from the lock files (npm ci · bin/setup.sh · scripts/film.py) ──
node_modules/
.cache/
**/build/
# safety net: generated audio never belongs next to code (the pipeline writes to outputs/<film>/build/)
**/public/audio
**/audio-src/vo

# ── Local tooling ──
.playwright-mcp/
.DS_Store
*.log
**/film.lock.json
